# .worktreeinclude — gitignored local state auto-copied into each new worktree at creation
# (Claude Code feature; .gitignore syntax; only files that match a pattern AND are gitignored
# are copied, so tracked files are never duplicated).
#
# Manifest.toml is deliberately absent: scripts/worktree_setup.sh copies it from the main
# checkout and then RESOLVES it against the branch's Project.toml, which a plain copy would skip.
#
# Maintainer-local agent configuration (gitignored; absent in a contributor's clone, and that
# is fine). scripts/worktree_setup.sh links the matching skills and the subagent when the
# private checkout exists.
CLAUDE.local.md
